+verify their sizes and locations. Pressure testing of the piping must be conducted in accordance with R.61-
+51.C.24(d). If there are any variations from the approved plans and specifications, such variations must be
+corrected by the contractor, or plans and specifications detailing the changes must be re-submitted for a
+construction permit revision prior to continuance of construction.
