+be submitted on a Change Order Request form and will not be granted if the request is received more than
+one year from the expiration date of the permit. Up to three permit extensions can be granted. Unless an
+extension can be granted as provided above, a new application, with the appropriate fee and permit package
+must be submitted for expired permits.
