+personnel must be provided within a two hundred (200) foot walking distance of the pool and in a location
+that it is easily accessible during the hours that the pool is in operation. Only permanently-mounted
+notification devices are acceptable to the Department. Mobile, voice over internet, or cordless telephones
+are not an acceptable alternative to permanently-mounted emergency notification devices. The physical
+address of the pool must be displayed at the emergency notification phone or device in a manner that is
+permanent and weather resistant.
+
