+and “E” public swimming pools that charge for admission. Bathhouse facilities shall be located within two
+hundred (200) feet of the swimming pool. Applicable Americans with Disabilities Act guidelines shall be
+observed. Every bathhouse must be provided with separate facilities for each sex with no inter-connection
+between the male and female facilities. The rooms must be so developed and planned that good sanitation
+can be maintained throughout the building at all times.
