+overflow must be built into the pool wall which will be of sufficient size to carry off water that could be
+supplied by the fill spout, rainfall, or automatic fill device. All such overflow devices must drain to an
+approved location and must have a minimum six (6) inch air gap or check valve. Overflows must discharge
