+	&quot;This act takes effect upon approval by the Governor and is effective beginning with taxes to be assessed for the year of its enactment.&quot;<br /><br />
+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 12-37-230.</span> Payments of services rendered in lieu of taxes by nonprofit housing corporations exempt under SECTION 12-37-220.<br /><br />
+	When any nonprofit housing corporation owns property within a county or municipality which is exempted from ad valorem taxes under SECTION 12-37-220, the county or the municipality or both are authorized to contract with such corporation for payments of services rendered by the county or municipality.<br /><br />
