+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 12-37-255.</span> Homestead exemption to continue; county auditor to be informed of change affecting eligibility.<br /><br />
+	(A) The homestead exemption initially granted pursuant to Section 12-37-250 continues to be effective for successive years in which the ownership of the homestead or the other qualifications for the exemption remain unchanged. Notification of a change affecting eligibility must be given immediately to the county auditor.<br /><br />
