+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 12-37-3230.</span> Auditor to determine assessed value of boats and watercraft; outboard motor.<br /><br />
+	Section effective January 1, 2027. See, also, section 12-37-3230 effective until January 1, 2027.<br /><br />
